    <section class="band" id="about">
      <h2 class="band-label">About</h2>
      <div class="band-body">
        <p class="lead">I'm a senior at UC Berkeley studying Data Science with an emphasis in Economics, graduating in May 2027.</p>
        <p>I like problems where machine learning and experimentation meet real product decisions.</p>
        <p>This past summer I was a Data Scientist Intern at Meta, working on Instagram ranking and server capacity. Before that I spent over a year at SwingVision building AI features for tennis and pickleball players. In my free time, I enjoy playing collegiate pickleball, club tennis, and exploring new coffee shops in the Bay Area.</p>
      </div>
